{"id":"vod_sn_38724","vodId":"38724","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"归宅部活动记录","name_cn":"归宅部活动记录","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ee89f2ba3233979747cd33e87ecc5d91.jpg"},"summary":"由于实在不擅长处理复杂的人际关系，升入高中不久的少女安藤夏希（木户衣吹 配音）决定不参加任何社团，成为一个名符其实的“归宅部”（放学后直接回家的学生）。谁知她所在的学校竟然真的存在一个实体“归宅部”。阴差阳错下，夏希和高一新生塔野花梨（结名美月 配音）加入进去，并结识了三位二年级的学姐：永远没心没肺的部长道明寺樱（小林美晴 配音）、萩月流古武术传人大萩牡丹（相内沙英 配音）以及超级财阀家的千金九重克蕾雅（千本木彩花 配音）。每日里五个女孩无所事事，却总又能想出无聊脱力的话题来，丰富着她们看似单调实则有趣的高校生活……　　本片根据くろは的同名原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BC7fBXfgca1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nEMvtBZL411/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZzTMa82SyH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PTWzXRpLjV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t0J5RLunL21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4Anx3mLkL71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QYkKg2yCn51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vLEs6y5dxU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JQVGYM1q3k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N4kcwJx0QD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wXakrHsHMx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/piECReUfKU1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:55.450Z"}